On Aug 29, 9:44=A0am, Stuart Wheaton <sdwhea...@fuse.net> wrote:
> How come I can get killed by a rolling boulder trap but I can't squish a
> monster by rolling a boulder onto it?
>
> Stuart

If you trigger a rolling boulder trap so that it hits another monster,
or if you lead another monster over the trap so it triggers the trap
itself, the monster will be injured and maybe killed. But neither you
nor other monsters can make boulders roll on their own; only rolling
boulder traps can. (Giants can *throw* boulders but not roll them.)


